  "body": "Both Firefox and Chrome produce `\"http://foo.bar/?%27\"` on `(new URL(\"http://foo.bar/?\\'\")).href`. Spec does not include single quotes in the encode set used for queries.\r\n\r\nChrome additionally encodes single quotes within hostnames, but Firefox does not.\r\n\r\nShould we update the spec here?\r\n\r\ncc @annevk @SimonSapin @domenic ",
